  \item \textbf{Image registry:} GitHub Container Registry
        (\texttt{ghcr.io/tefaa1/mscms/*}).
  \item \textbf{Local orchestration:} \texttt{docker-compose.full.yml}
        bundles all microservices, infrastructure containers,
        and FastAPI ML services into one declarative stack.
  \item \textbf{Seed strategy:} Spring \texttt{@PostConstruct}-style
        seeders gated by \texttt{app.seed.enabled=true} populate every
        service with realistic FC Barcelona data on first boot.
\end{itemize}
