about (matches, transfers, fan reach).

\subsection*{Sponsorship Page}

\textbf{Description:} CRUD over their own
\texttt{sponsor\_contract\_offers} rows.

\textbf{Key Features:}
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*]
  \item Submit new offer: value, duration, conditions, sport
        targeting.
  \item Track offer status (\texttt{PENDING}, \texttt{ACCEPTED},
        \texttt{REJECTED}).
  \item Notifications on decision.
\end{itemize}

\textbf{Result:} The Spotify and Nike sponsors in the seed appear
with \texttt{ACCEPTED} contracts; Damm and Beko appear
\texttt{PENDING} and surface to the sport manager's decision queue.

\screenshot{screenshots/sponsor-page.png}%
